# Web Development

Auto-attached when editing web files. Full skill: [SKILL.md](mdc:.agents/skills/web-development/SKILL.md).

- Next.js App Router + TypeScript (strict, no `any`).
- Server Components by default; Client Components only when interactivity requires it.
- Tailwind CSS for layout and tokens. Keep WebGL/3D under `components/scene/*`.
- Server-first rendering; add client motion/3D only where it materially helps.
- Budgets: LCP < 2.5s · INP < 200ms · CLS < 0.1.
- Respect `prefers-reduced-motion`; every 3D scene needs a text equivalent + static fallback.
- Don't add dependencies without justification; prefer editing existing components; include
  tests for interaction changes.
- Build in small steps (scaffold → iterate → integrate), not one giant prompt.
